<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<chapter xml:id="ch-functions" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Functions</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>
			You will be familiar with the notion of a function in mathematics and have used them many times up to now. But in this chapter we just wish to formalise the definition of a function and introduce various properties of functions. Throughout this we wish to emphasize the treatment of functions as mathematical objects <em>in themselves</em>.
		</p>
  </introduction>

